 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iERVsYCgg_AQ7kNvwFrcdv7&_nc_oc=AdpauwUPcYmRCaPUr-Qhl3A0NjzGFMwznCL5Rsn5qEBqmUPqJn_BruBKcbb1xc5H2PM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExNFh7haJoSWMRGxYGZWp8zxAOYnhLa53d7OHoW0--xQ&oe=6A75F741"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pKF_jydnAgwQ7kNvwEQu5K2&_nc_oc=AdqnhR8My0rz7hcCYFPOd1qdN_yWGrJCzuxEYGkeFNLuLKQgdS6jRqx7Zkqv_T7nrqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG7H_4d9HGSnA6WDK9sS_1U9fEZ-kYvWcINA0r15uhkLQ&oe=6A75CC66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rdAy8fDUFTUQ7kNvwFRHV5C&_nc_oc=AdqFi0tZDWxH_pnQquxi4KaPI4nynF0dRxwcHcPDlfA4qrasOACADE9B4YKhxqp5gFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGNL3fLJgoBH4tSa_CEyXBmYwqL0Rny75PMXR3MA-b48g&oe=6A75D65C"}, {"fil